    "description": [
        false,
        "The TPS61089x represents the TPS61089 and the TPS610891. The TPS61089x is a fully-integrated synchronous boost converter with a 19-mΩ main power switch and a 27-mΩ rectifier switch. The device provides a high efficiency and small size power solution for portable equipment. The TPS61089x features wide input voltage range from 2.7 V to 12 V to support applications powered with single cell or two cell Lithium ion/polymer batteries. The TPS61089x has 7-A continuous switch current capability and provides output voltage up to 12.6 V."
